    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "The reciprocal Bezout identity simplifies every triangular unit stage to one Euclidean division. If C_k^0=f_0d_k+r_k with deg r_k<e, then rho_k=-r_k and s_k=d_k+a_minus r_k. Hence the stage survives exactly when deg r_k<=1; no modular inversion or second exact division is required.",
